  "described": {
    "alt_text": "A stencil airbrush painting of a symmetrical totem figure with a feathered headdress, in greens with rust brown patches on white paper.",
    "description": "A square stencil airbrush painting on white paper. The same frontal totem figure as the other Totem pieces, rendered in grass green and lime gradients with rust and terracotta patches inside many cells, like moss on brick. Thin white gaps separate the cells.",
    "impression": "The totem overgrown: green with rust showing through, as if it had been standing in a jungle for a long time. Of the four colourways this is the one that looks most like an actual artefact. Earthy and patient.",
